00:14:11.510 --> 00:14:14.500
Come on, you Tom.

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:17.860
There she goes, boys.

00:14:18.280 --> 00:14:19.080
That's what I'm talking about.

00:14:47.080 --> 00:14:48.840
It was enough for a couple.

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:52.910
Come on, come on, give us another word.

00:15:26.700 --> 00:15:29.970
I want you to let bygones be bygone.

00:15:30.440 --> 00:15:34.860
Come home. I'm having trouble with neighboring ranchers and have a hunch something's going to happen.

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:39.150
Please don't disappoint me. I need you. You're dead.

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:42.960
You going, Tom?

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:46.620
You bet I am. How about you, Wendy?

00:15:48.960 --> 00:15:52.140
What a question. Where you go, I go.

00:15:53.300 --> 00:15:54.640
You're a real pal, Wendy.

00:15:56.120 --> 00:15:57.000
But I'm dumping.

00:16:00.090 --> 00:16:04.190
Now listen, fellas, when I jump you, back me up and pile in.

00:16:04.680 --> 00:16:05.300
We're with you.

00:16:05.960 --> 00:16:09.110
I know, but I don't want any stalling.

00:16:10.290 --> 00:16:11.830
You're getting plenty of dough for this job.

00:16:15.900 --> 00:16:21.240
If that letter don't look so good to me, there's something dead wrong.

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:23.020
That's what I think.

00:16:23.660 --> 00:16:24.900
Come on, let's move you out of here.

00:16:25.140 --> 00:16:25.540
All right.

00:16:25.920 --> 00:16:26.560
Go on, fellas.

00:16:27.450 --> 00:16:27.970
