00:16:41.080 --> 00:16:43.280
Oh, yeah? We're not good enough for your company, eh?

00:16:43.420 --> 00:16:44.380
Oh, don't be foolish.

00:16:44.740 --> 00:16:46.810
Eh? How would you like a pension of no?

