Client, it looks good.

00:20:32.140 --> 00:20:33.540
Maybe I'll catch a doctor, huh?

00:20:35.120 --> 00:20:36.960
Say, you mind your own business.

00:20:37.300 --> 00:20:38.200
I don't need a doctor.

00:20:38.900 --> 00:20:40.860
All I need is for you to get the heck out of here.

00:20:41.090 --> 00:20:41.490
Yes, sir.

00:20:42.020 --> 00:20:43.520
But this pudding is very good, sir.

00:20:43.680 --> 00:20:44.780
Will you get out of here?

00:20:45.000 --> 00:20:45.440
Yes, sir.

00:20:46.590 --> 00:20:47.130
What's on this again?

00:20:47.330 --> 00:20:48.130
I'm sick me up there.

00:20:48.570 --> 00:20:50.010
Well, well, give me something to your mom.

00:20:50.250 --> 00:20:51.650
Hey, what are you calling me?

00:20:52.130 --> 00:20:53.430
I said the pudding's very fine, sir.

00:20:53.470 --> 00:20:54.270
Get out of here!

00:20:54.370 --> 00:20:54.730
Yes, sir.

00:20:56.220 --> 00:20:58.040
Yes, sir.

00:21:20.260 --> 00:21:25.920
You beggar, you can't have any of that meat, but I'll tell you what you can have.

