The lunch is on the table.

00:25:45.410 --> 00:25:54.870
Well, Wendy, the old ranch looks pretty good to me.

00:25:55.430 --> 00:25:57.020
It sure does.

00:27:09.916 --> 00:27:11.196
We sure made a quick getaway.

00:27:11.580 --> 00:27:11.920
Yeah.

00:27:12.348 --> 00:27:15.348
Let's hustle on over to the ranch house and keep our eye peeled on the way for him.

